text.en:
Reorganizing the Inter-Agency Council for the Pasig River
Urban Development. The IAC-PRUD is hereby reorganized and shall now be
composed of the following:
Chairperson
Vice Chairperson : Chairperson, Metropolitan Manila Development Authority
: Secretary, Department of Human Settlements and Urban
Development;
Secretary, Department of Public Works and Highways;
Secretary, Department of Environment and Natural Resources;
Secretary, Department of the Interior and Local Government;
Secretary, Department of Labor and Employment;
Secretary, Department of Tourism;
Secretary, Department of Transportation;
Secretary, Department of Finance;
Secretary, DBM;
Chairperson, National Historical Commission of the Philippines;
Chairperson, National Commission for Culture and the Arts;
General Manager, Philippine Ports Authority;
Commandant, Philippine Coast Guard;
General Manager, Laguna Lake Development Authority;
Chief Executive Officer, Tourism Infrastructure and Enterprise
Zone Authority;
General Manager, National Housing Authority; and
General Manager, National Development Company.
The Secretariat of the IAC-PRUD shall be designated by the IAC-PRUD from
among the members thereof.
The Chairperson, Vice Chairperson, and members of the IAC-PRUD may
designate their alternates, with ranks not lower than Assistant Secretary or its
equivalent, who shall be fully authorized to decide for or on their behalf.
